{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "Signs a Data and verifies, exercises the sign→canonicalize→hash→sign→verify path\nend-to-end. A clean pass means the typed signing surface is intact. Signing makes a new,\nsigned value (the signature is a layer around the data); `write to` keeps it.",
  "step": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "archive identity 'roundtripSigner', force, on error ignore",
      "line": {
        "number": 5,
        "indent": 0
